  "goodToKnow": "Die Produktivität is productivity: die Arbeitsproduktivität, die Produktivität steigern. Germany has high productivity per hour worked but relatively short working hours, with around 30 days of paid holiday for many full-time workers. Debates about Homeoffice and the four-day week often focus on Produktivität. Produktiv means productive. Like all -tät nouns, it's feminine and stressed on the last syllable. It has no plural."
